rt style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic post-rock soundtrack that rewards you for being stylish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game tutorial and videos to help familiarise yourself with the movement system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for 1st-person and to be motion sick friendly.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Team Boars"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/0a15e14d15cd1b5122ffc04bde5d09eeed93255d/header.jpg?t=1760697391","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3676250/1325591476/62db818802b56f17270ca467a8e7e88dbef41bee/1755297415/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755299096","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3676250/1325591476/62db818802b56f17270ca467a8e7e88dbef41bee/1755297415/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755299096","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3676250/1325591476/62db818802b56f17270ca467a8e7e88dbef41bee/1755297415/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755299096","id":257183952,"name":"Movement Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183952/f5772405be8ee65e4e018469e426e88cbdacee9b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755299096"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3676250/871497/29e53dce716e5188c124c2d9789c4f2efc175398/1750398264/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745614880","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3676250/871497/29e53dce716e5188c124c2d9789c4f2efc175398/1750398264/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745614880","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3676250/871497/29e53dce716e5188c124c2d9789c4f2efc175398/1750398264/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745614880","id":257126797,"name":"Stylish Gameplay Clips","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.stea